What is the output of the following accessor demonstration?
```java
class SensorDevice {
    private int reading = 25;
    public int getReading() {
        return reading;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        SensorDevice sd = new SensorDevice();
        System.out.println(sd.getReading());
    }
}
```

